1. d4 Nf6 2. c4 e6 3. Nf3 d5 4. Nc3 dxc4 5. e3 a6 6. Bxc4 b5 7. Bd3 Bb7 8. Qe2 (8. a3 c5 9. dxc5 Bxc5 10. b4 Bd6 (10... Be7 11. O-O Nbd7 12. Bb2 O-O 13. Rc1 Rc8 14. e4 Nb6 15. Qe2 Nc4 16. Bxc4 Rxc4 17. Ne5 Rc7 18. Rfd1 Qc8 19. f3 Rd8 20. Qe3 Ne8 21. Rxd8 Qxd8 22. Rd1 Qc8 23. Nb1 h6 24. Nd3 Rc2 25. Bd4 {Banikas,H-Morozevich,A/WchJM U20 1997/EXP 59/1-0 (57)}) 11. Bb2 O-O 12. Rc1 Qe7 13. O-O Nbd7 14. Qe2 Rac8 15. Rfd1 Nb6 16. Nd2 Rfd8 17. h3 Bb8 18. Nb3 Nc4 19. Bxc4 Rxd1+ 20. Nxd1 Rxc4 21. Rxc4 bxc4 22. Nc5 Qd6 23. f4 Bd5 24. Be5 Qb6 25. Nc3 Ba7 26. Bxf6 gxf6 27. Qg4+ Kh8 28. Nxd5 exd5 29. Qc8+ Kg7 {½-½ Epishin,V-Ivanov,S/St.Petersburg 1997/CBM 59}) 8... b4 (8... Nbd7 9. e4 c5 10. e5 Bxf3 11. gxf3 cxd4 12. Nxb5 Nc5 13. exf6 Nxd3+ 14. Qxd3 Qa5+ 15. Bd2 Qxb5 16. Qxd4 Bc5 17. Qe4 O-O 18. fxg7 Rfd8 19. Bc3 Rd5 20. Qe2 Bb4 21. Qxb5 {½-½ Fiorito,F-Sorokin,M/ARG-chT Buenos Aires 1995/EXT 95ch}) 9. Na4 Qd5 $1 (9... Nbd7 $5 {[%cal Yc7c5]} 10. e4 c5 11. dxc5 (11. d5 $2 exd5 12. exd5+ Qe7 $17) (11. e5 Nd5 12. O-O {looks similar to merano line}) 11... Nxc5 12. Nxc5 Bxc5 13. O-O $14) 10. Qc2 {[%cal Gc2c7]} (10. O-O Nbd7 {[%cal Yc7c5]}) 10... Nbd7 11. b3 (11. Qxc7 $2 Rc8 12. Qg3 (12. Qf4 Bd6 (12... Qc6 13. Nc5 Bxc5 14. dxc5 Nxc5 $36) 13. Qh4 h6 {[%csl Rh4][%cal Yg7g5]}) 12... Qc6 13. Nc5 Bxc5 14. dxc5 Nxc5 15. Bc2 O-O {[%cal Yc6b5]}) 11... Bd6 (11... c5 12. Bb2 cxd4 13. Bxd4 e5 (13... Qh5 {[%cal Ye6e5,Ye5e4]}) 14. Bc4) 12. Bb2 O-O 13. Rd1 {[%cal Gd1d5]} Rfc8 14. h3 (14. O-O Qh5 15. e4 c5 16. dxc5 (16. Qb1 $5) 16... Bxc5 $15 {[%csl Ra4]}) 14... Qh5 15. e4 c5 16. dxc5 (16. Qe2 cxd4 17. Bxd4 Qg6 {[%cal Yg6e4,Yg6g2]} 18. O-O $1 Nh5 $1 $36 {[%cal Yh5f4]}) 16... Bxc5 17. Qe2 (17. O-O Ba7 {-game}) 17... Ba7 18. O-O $11 Nc5 19. Nxc5 Bxc5 20. Rd2 a5 21. Rfd1 Rd8 {[%csl Re4] White have problem with pawn e4,after e4-e5 black receive square d5 and strong pressure on the diagonal a8-h1.} 22. Bxf6 {White try to neutralize pressure to pawn e4.} gxf6 23. Bb5 Rxd2 24. Rxd2 Qg6 $6 {[%cal Yb7e4,Yg6e4]} (24... f5 $142 25. exf5 Qxf5 26. Rd7 $11) 25. Rc2 $1 Bf8 (25... Rc8 $6 26. Rc4 $1 {[%cal Ge2c2]} (26. Ba6 Bxf2+ 27. Kxf2 Rxc2 28. Qxc2 Bxa6 $17) 26... Ba7 27. Rxc8+ Bxc8 28. Qc4 Bb7 29. Bc6 $16) 26. Bc6 Ba6 $1 {After exchange of whitecolour bishops, knight of white gets much more stronger than bishop of black.} (26... Bxc6 27. Rxc6 $16) 27. Qd1 Rc8 28. Ba4 $6 (28. Qd7 Qh6 $11 {[%cal Yh6f4,Yf4d6]}) 28... Qxe4 29. Rxc8 Bxc8 30. Qd8 Bb7 31. Qxf6 {[%csl Rf7][%cal Ga4e8]} Qb1+ 32. Kh2 Qf5 $6 (32... Qg6 33. Qf4 Bd5 $15) 33. Qxf5 exf5 34. Nd4 {[%cal Gd4f5,Ga4c6]} Bd6+ 35. Kg1 Be4 {[%cal Ye4b1,Yb1a2]} 36. Bd7 $132 {[%csl Rf5]} Bb1 (36... f4 37. Bf5 $11) 37. Nxf5 Bc5 $1 {[%csl Ra2,Rb3] In case of exchange blacksquare bishop of black for knight of white black will have good chanses to win because of weaknesses of pawn a2 and b3} 38. Ne3 Bxe3 39. fxe3 Bxa2 40. Ba4 Bb1 {[%cal Yb1e4,Yg8g7,Yg7e5]} 41. Kf2 {[%cal Gf2g3,Gg3f4]} Be4 (41... Kg7 42. Kf3 Kf6 43. Kf4 {[%cal Gg2g4,Gh3h4,Gg4g5]}) 42. g4 Kg7 43. Kg3 Kf6 44. Kf4 Bc2 45. e4 (45. g5+ Ke6 46. h4 f6 {-see game}) 45... Ke6 46. g5 f6 47. h4 fxg5+ 48. hxg5 Bd1 $22 49. Ke3 (49. e5 $2 Bc2 $19) 49... Ke5 50. Kd3 {[%cal Gd3b5,Gb5a5]} Bf3 (50... Kf4 51. Kd4 (51. g6 $1 hxg6 52. Kd4 g5 53. e5 g4 54. e6 g3 55. e7 Bh5 56. Bc6 Be8 (56... Bg6 57. Kc4 Ke5 58. Kb5 Kd6 59. Bg2 Kxe7 60. Kxa5 Kd6 61. Kxb4 Bf7 62. Kc3 Bd5 63. Bf1 Ke5 64. b4 $11 {[%cal Gb4b6]}) (56... Kf5 $2 57. Ke3 $18) 57. Bxe8 $1 (57. Bg2 Kf5 $19 {[%cal Yf5f6,Ya5a4]}) 57... g2 58. Bf7 g1=Q+ 59. Kc4 Qf1+ 60. Kc5 Qf2+ 61. Kc6 Qc2+ 62. Kb6 a4 $11 (62... Qf2+ $2 63. Kb7 Qg2+ 64. Kb8 $16)) (51. Kc4 Kxg5 52. Kb5 h5 53. Kxa5 h4 54. e5 h3 55. Bc6 h2 56. Kxb4 Kf5 57. Kc3 Kxe5 58. b4 Kf4 59. b5 Bf3 $19) 51... Kxg5 52. e5 h5 53. Kc5 h4 54. e6 Kf6 $1 (54... h3 55. e7 Bh5 56. e8=Q Bxe8 57. Bxe8 h2 58. Bc6 a4 59. Kxb4 axb3 60. Kxb3 $11) 55. Kd6 h3 56. e7 Bh5 57. e8=Q Bxe8 58. Bxe8 h2 59. Bc6 a4 60. bxa4 b3 61. a5 b2 62. a6 b1=Q 63. a7 h1=Q 64. Bxh1 Qxh1 $19) 51. Kc4 Bxe4 52. Be8 (52. Kb5 Kd4 53. Kxa5 Kc3 $19) 52... Bc2 (52... Bd5+ $1 53. Kb5 Kd4 54. Kxa5 Kc3 55. g6 (55. Bd7 Bxb3 56. Bf5 Bg8 $19) 55... hxg6 56. Bxg6 Bxb3 57. Bf5 (57. Bh5 Bc2 58. Bf7 Bd3) 57... Bd1 58. Be6 Be2 59. Ka4 Bc4 60. Bf5 b3 61. Ka3 b2 62. Bg6 Bb3 63. Bb1 Bd1 $22 64. Ka2 (64. Bg6 Bc2 $19) 64... Bc2 $19) 53. Kb5 Kd4 54. Bf7 Kc3 55. Kxa5 Bd1 (55... Bxb3 56. g6 hxg6 57. Bxg6 Bd1 58. Bf7 Be2 $19) 56. Bg8 Bc2 1/2-1/2

